{"3566300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Building", "steam_appid": 3566300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the proud owner of a building. Through cutting-edge simulation technology, you can experience the following:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at your building in stunning 3D with rotation and zoom controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP and prestige stars for your building variations by watching them in all their glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a nice song. Or mute it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetic Items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While observing your building, you will unlock new skins in your inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your building into a bustling mall, a frozen apartment, an overgrown skyscraper and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, sell or hoard your skins for eternity on the Steam Marketplace.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drop Chances</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An item is dropped every 3 hours of consecutive playtime.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common </strong>— 60%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncommon</strong> — 30%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare </strong>— 6.5%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Rare</strong> — 3.4%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique </strong>— 0.1%</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the proud owner of a building. Through cutting-edge simulation technology, you can experience the following:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at your building in stunning 3D with rotation and zoom controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\